$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=psiaporth  LOC_AFTER=?

* Character orthogonality for psi in a residue class: psiAP is the average over all Dirichlet characters mod Q of the character-twisted psi, weighted by the character at an inverse B of A (Lean: psiAP_eq_inv_totient_mul_sum_psiChar).

